SUMMARY:CLNG: Ch 1: Comic strip creation  (note some students will need to finish this for HW.&#160; However, some students already finished this in class.)
DESCRIPTION:Students create a physical comic strip (handout provided in class, in Chapter 1 packet.)  Comic strip should feature ALL off the following topics, written in Latin or Ancient Greek: -greeting and farewell -asking and telling a name -asking and telling an emotion -any three extra words from Online Textbook (Hands Up Latin)   Comic strip will be graded on all of the "C"s (all discussed with class in advance):&#160; completion, content, creativity, craftsmanship, composition  Students will get feedback on their comic strips by means of paper rubrics, which will be attached to the comic strips when they are graded and handed back.&#160;
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CLASS:PUBLIC
PRIORITY:3
CATEGORIES:podium,events
END:VEVENT
